{"suttaId":"thag4.2","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[1341,1353],"vripara":"271"},"segments":{"thag4.2:0.4":"Bhaguttheragāthā","thag4.2:1.1":"“Ahaṃ middhena pakato, vihārā upanikkhamiṃ;","thag4.2:1.3":"Caṅkamaṃ abhiruhanto, tattheva papatiṃ chamā.","thag4.2:2.1":"“Gattāni parimajjitvā, punapāruyha caṅkamaṃ;","thag4.2:2.3":"Caṅkame caṅkamiṃ sohaṃ, ajjhattaṃ susamāhito.","thag4.2:3.1":"“Tato me manasīkāro, yoniso udapajjatha;","thag4.2:3.3":"Ādīnavo pāturahu, nibbidā samatiṭṭhatha.","thag4.2:4.1":"“Tato cittaṃ vimucci me, passa dhammasudhammataṃ;","thag4.2:4.3":"Tisso vijjā anuppattā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanan”ti.","thag4.2:4.5":"… Bhagutthero …."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
